      "id": "sol.amc-8-2017-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "This expression can be reduced as follows: \\[ \\begin{align*} \\sqrt{16\\sqrt{8\\sqrt{4}}} &= \\sqrt{16\\sqrt{16}} \\\\ &= \\sqrt{64}\\\\ &= 8 \\end{align*} \\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
